            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/747ed1cb8081e6bfd276d3678993b635.avif?t=1790876247\" width=500 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of professional luthierie. Starting from a modest garage, you must build your reputation by delivering flawless craftsmanship. Take on challenging contracts, master the technical intricacies of various instruments, and transform your humble workspace into the ultimate guitar haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/2fe2657f7aa11124b94a7461f30464fb.poster.avif?t=1790876247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/2fe2657f7aa11124b94a7461f30464fb.webm?t=1790876247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/2fe2657f7aa11124b94a7461f30464fb.mp4?t=1790876247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/b54a35270b8eadbf9691430818437f9a.avif?t=1790876247\" width=661 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for true enthusiasts, Guitar Workshop offers unparalleled depth. Every component matters. Experience the satisfying process of stripping a guitar down to its core. Use your workbench to interact directly with the instrument: unscrew every tuning peg, disconnect every wire, and catalog every individual part with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/df1e2d88fb06dcb980d349690261b56f.webp?t=1790876247\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/df1e2d88fb06dcb980d349690261b56f.poster.avif?t=1790876247\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=504 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/9247a8fa94d092c98aee1b704813bcfb.avif?t=1790876247\" width=482 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard Workbench: Your primary hub for assembly, disassembly and inspection.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electronics Workbench: A dedicated space to isolate pickguards and control plates. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painting Station:  Completely strip the body of all hardware to access the painting interface. Use precision sliders and controls to apply stunning finishes, from classic solid colors to complex bursts and wood grain enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/db63ab9636104415465404ba9c877594.poster.avif?t=1790876247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/db63ab9636104415465404ba9c877594.webm?t=1790876247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/db63ab9636104415465404ba9c877594.mp4?t=1790876247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/2fbe51e2b60f7de5c3b51f37da58e008.avif?t=1790876247\" width=446 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow your business through a variety of professional contracts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repairs: From basic restringing to advanced structural restoration.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refinishing: Breathe new life into worn instruments with professional-grade paint jobs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bespoke Builds: Engineer unique guitars from the ground up, following strict client specifications from A to Z.(Work in progress)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Earn Profit to fund your growth, XP to unlock premium hardware, and Reputation to access high-end clientele and workshop expansions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/ed4248c2b553bea1a427ea423a3f6872.poster.avif?t=1790876247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/ed4248c2b553bea1a427ea423a3f6872.webm?t=1790876247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/ed4248c2b553bea1a427ea423a3f6872.mp4?t=1790876247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/879442effa30926aed531f33a87ad4e8.avif?t=1790876247\" width=272 height=74 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop Customization: Personalize your workspace. Modify walls, floors, and layouts to create an environment that inspires your craft.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive Parts Catalog: Access an integrated tablet to source hundreds of realistic components: , Bridges, pickups, potentiometers, switches, and more. (Planned)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private Collection: Keep your best work. Display your custom masterpieces on wall mounts or floor stands, separate from your commercial contracts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auction House: Maximize profits by selling high-value creations or surplus stock to rare collectors. (WIP)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/c1f5d9b2d1fd945cde04797fd72a6086.poster.avif?t=1790876247\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/c1f5d9b2d1fd945cde04797fd72a6086.webm?t=1790876247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/c1f5d9b2d1fd945cde04797fd72a6086.mp4?t=1790876247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/744960/extras/570051b725a42d1a72248d9c3e529356.avif?t=1790876247\" width=411 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I'm committed to evolving Guitar Workshop alongside our community. My immediate development goals include:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raw Wood Crafting: A new specialized machine to custom bodies and necks from scratch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Content: New mission types and a continuously growing catalog of licensed-style parts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join me on this journey and help craft the definitive luthier experience!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
